Paseo Native

An independent Android client implemented in Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.
It is not an official Paseo release.

The Paseo protocol and client behavior are based on the Apache-2.0-licensed
Paseo project: https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo
Reference revision: abc97e0545bb92e43eb96027102d845657c0a2eb

The upstream license is included in LICENSE. This implementation does not
bundle the React Native client, JavaScript runtime, or upstream daemon.

Relay endpoint security follows the upstream packages/relay and protocol
pairing formats. Noise NK compatibility vectors are included for testing;
their original vector source URLs are retained in the JSON resource.

This app uses Bouncy Castle 1.86 lightweight cryptographic primitives,
licensed under the MIT license: https://www.bouncycastle.org/licence.html
